## 🧾 Analyst Notes (How this maps to real SOC work)

- Status hygiene (In Progress → Closed) prevents duplicate investigations and establishes accountability.
- Prioritization discipline (severity + age) is essential when queues are large and time-to-detect matters.
- Verdict quality depends on evidence: alert fields, surrounding events, and validating assumptions (not intuition).
- Escalation readiness: L1 is expected to escalate when confidence indicates real threat or when deeper remediation is needed.

